──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GDPR notice — this software processes voice recordings and transcripts that
constitute personal data (and, for voice, biometric data per art. 9 GDPR).
Any deployment must :
  - Be hosted in the European Union (Paris or Amsterdam regions)
  - Sign DPAs (Data Processing Agreements) with all third-party processors
    (Anthropic, HappyScribe, Scaleway, etc.)
  - Anonymize PII before any LLM call where possible
  - Provide a process for the customer's right to be forgotten
    (anonymisation via the B2T API `AnonymisationCustomer` operation)
